    "description": "An upgrade refers to the process of updating or replacing an existing installation of PHP or any library or component with a newer version. Major upgrade refers to a change in the first digit of the version, while minor upgrades are for the other numbers in the version.\n\nAn upgrade often requires a migration: the current code has to be made compatible with the current version, but also with the upcoming version. ",
